## 🔧 Arquitectura Técnica

### Stack Tecnológico

#### Frontend
```javascript
{
  "framework": "React 19",
  "bundler": "Vite 7.2.4",
  "styling": "Tailwind CSS 3.4",
  "icons": "Lucide React",
  "charts": "Recharts 3.7",
  "animations": "Framer Motion 12.29",
  "routing": "React Router DOM 7.13",
  "3D": "@react-three/fiber + drei"
}
```

#### Backend
```javascript
{
  "runtime": "Node.js",
  "framework": "Express 5.2",
  "auth": "JWT + bcryptjs",
  "security": "helmet, express-rate-limit",
  "AI": "@google/generative-ai (Gemini)",
  "database": "pg (PostgreSQL client)"
}
```

#### Database
```sql
-- PostgreSQL (Supabase/Vercel Postgres)
Tables:
  - users (autenticación)
  - transactions (finanzas)
  - categories (categorías)
  - tasks (productividad)
  - debts (deudas)
  - bot_conversations (IA chat)
  - market_snapshots (inversiones cache)
  - user_preferences (configuración)
```

#### Deployment
- **Frontend**: Vercel (static site)
- **Backend**: Vercel Serverless Functions
- **Database**: Supabase (PostgreSQL managed)
- **AI**: Google Gemini API (free tier)
- **Market Data**: Alpha Vantage + CoinGecko APIs

### Estructura del Proyecto
```
AsisT/
├── src/                          # Frontend React
│   ├── features/                 # Módulos por feature
│   │   ├── auth/                # Autenticación
│   │   ├── finance/             # Finanzas
│   │   ├── planner/             # Tareas
│   │   ├── gemini/              # IA Assistant
│   │   ├── investments/         # Inversiones
│   │   ├── home/                # Dashboard
│   │   └── landing/             # Landing page
│   ├── components/              # Componentes compartidos
│   ├── context/                 # React Context
│   └── utils/                   # Utilidades
│
├── server/                       # Backend Node.js
│   ├── routes/                  # Endpoints API
│   ├── middleware/              # Auth, rate limiting
│   ├── services/                # Lógica de negocio
│   ├── migrations/              # SQL migrations
│   └── db.js                    # Conexión database
│
└── public/                       # Assets estáticos
```

